Responsible (R): VP Legal
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W125_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W125_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
