Responsible (R): CEO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W127_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W127_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W127_Task13" name="Quarterly Review">
