Responsible (R): Executive Team
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W127_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W127_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
