Responsible (R): Compliance Mgr
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W186_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W186_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
