    <bpmn:process id="W_W276" name="W276. Asset Under Construction (AUC) &amp; Mass Capitalization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: A new store construction project begins (W225), requiring cost accumulation over several months before go-live.
Frequency: Project-based (10-15 per year)
Volume: Hundreds of AP invoices per project; typical new store build-out costs PHP 15–30M with 30–60 capitalized asset components (HVAC, racking, shelving, lighting, leasehold improvements, POS hardware, IT infrastructure, signage)
Owner: Fixed Asset Accountant
Participants: Engineering/Project Manager (W225), AP Clerk (W7), Fixed Asset Accountant, Controller (approval for capitalization), IT Asset Manager (for IT equipment classification)
Source: workflow W276 — Asset Under Construction (AUC) &amp; Mass Capitalization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W276_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W276_Lane1" name="Fixed Asset Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W276_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W276_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W276_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W276_Lane2" name="AP Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W276_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W276_Lane3" name="Engineering">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W276_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W276_Lane4" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W276_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W276_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W276_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W276_Start6" name="A new store construction project begins (W225), requiring cost accumulation over several…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W276_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W276_Task7" name="Finance creates an Internal Order / WBS Element tagged as Asset Under…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance creates an Internal Order / WBS Element tagged as Asset Under Construction (AUC).
Responsible (R): Fixed Asset Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W276_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W276_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W276_Task8" name="AP posts all contractor invoices, materials, and direct labor against this AUC…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AP posts all contractor invoices, materials, and direct labor against this AUC over 6 months.
Responsible (R): AP Clerk
Accountable (A): AP Supervisor
Duration: 10 min/invoice</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W276_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W276_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W276_Task9" name="Engineering confirms Store Operational Handover (W227).">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Engineering confirms Store Operational Handover (W227).
Responsible (R): Engineering/PM
Accountable (A): VP Store Dev
Duration: Per W227</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W276_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W276_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W276_Task10" name="Fixed Asset Accountant executes a mass settlement profile in the ERP.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Fixed Asset Accountant executes a mass settlement profile in the ERP.
Responsible (R): Fixed Asset Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W276_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W276_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W276_Task11" name="The system zero-balances the AUC and distributes the millions in costs across…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: The system zero-balances the AUC and distributes the millions in costs across dozens of distinct Capitalized Fixed Assets (HVAC, racking, leasehold improvements) based on predefined allocation rules.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W276_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W276_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W276_Task12" name="Depreciation begins automatically on the newly created assets.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Depreciation begins automatically on the newly created assets.
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W276_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W276_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W276_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W276_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W276_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-289 (ensure controlled execution — GL &amp; Financial Close (PA-17.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Fixed Asset Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
