    <bpmn:process id="W_W426" name="W426. Annual Conflict of Interest (COI) &amp; Gift Policy Disclosure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual corporate governance calendar (typically Q1)
Frequency: Annual
Volume: ~6,911 employees (all regular staff) + ~800–1,000 active vendors
Owner: Compliance Manager
Participants: All Employees, All Vendors, VP Legal &amp; Compliance, Internal Audit
Source: workflow W426 — Annual Conflict of Interest (COI) &amp; Gift Policy Disclosure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W426_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W426_Lane1" name="Compliance Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W426_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W426_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W426_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W426_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W426_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W426_Lane2" name="All Employees">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W426_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W426_Lane3" name="All Vendors">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W426_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W426_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W426_Start5" name="Annual corporate governance calendar (typically Q1)">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W426_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W426_Task6" name="Cycle Launch">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Cycle Launch: Compliance Manager triggers the annual COI disclosure campaign via the HR portal and Vendor Portal
Responsible (R): Compliance Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W426_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W426_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W426_Task7" name="Employee Disclosure">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Employee Disclosure: All regular employees log into the HR portal to complete the digital COI form — (a) confirm awareness of the COI/Gift Policy; (b) disclose any relatives working within BuildRight; (c) disclose any personal interest in vendors/competitors; (d) record &quot;Nil&quot; if no conflicts exist
Responsible (R): All Employees
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W426_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W426_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W426_Task8" name="Vendor Disclosure">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Vendor Disclosure: Active vendors log into the Vendor Portal to complete the annual Vendor Integrity Statement — (a) disclose any relatives of BuildRight employees working for the vendor; (b) confirm compliance with the No-Gift Policy
Responsible (R): All Vendors
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W426_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W426_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W426_Task9" name="Initial Screening">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Initial Screening: Compliance Manager reviews disclosures; system flags &quot;Positive&quot; disclosures (where a relationship is declared) for manual review
Responsible (R): Compliance Mgr
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W426_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W426_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W426_Task10" name="Validation &amp; Action">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Validation &amp; Action: For flagged cases, Compliance Manager validates with the relevant Dept Head — (a) determine if a conflict exists; (b) implement &quot;Conflict Mitigation Plan&quot; (e.g., recusal from specific tenders, transfer of reporting line); (c) document the decision
Responsible (R): Compliance Mgr / Dept Head
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 1 week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W426_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W426_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W426_Task11" name="Audit Trail">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Audit Trail: Disclosures and mitigation plans are archived for Internal Audit review (W120)
Responsible (R): Compliance Mgr
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W426_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W426_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
