    <bpmn:process id="W_W474" name="W474. Enterprise Data Governance Council Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Scheduled quarterly DGC meeting, or ad-hoc escalation of data policy disputes
Frequency: Quarterly meetings; continuous policy oversight
Volume: 4 scheduled meetings/year; 2-5 major policy reviews/year; ad-hoc escalations
Owner: Chief Information Officer (CIO)
Participants: CIO, CFO, VP Supply Chain, VP Merchandising, Master Data Manager, BI Manager, Data Privacy Officer
Source: workflow W474 — Enterprise Data Governance Council Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W474_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W474_Lane1" name="Master Data Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W474_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W474_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W474_Lane2" name="CIO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W474_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W474_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W474_Lane3" name="DGC Members">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W474_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W474_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W474_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W474_Start5" name="Scheduled quarterly DGC meeting, or ad-hoc escalation of data policy disputes">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W474_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W474_Task6" name="Agenda Preparation &amp; KPI Review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Agenda Preparation &amp; KPI Review: Master Data Manager and BI Manager compile the Enterprise Data Quality Scorecard, highlighting critical gaps, duplicate rates, and compliance issues across all data domains.
Responsible (R): Master Data Manager
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W474_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W474_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W474_Task7" name="Dispute Escalation Review">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Dispute Escalation Review: If functional data stewards disagree on a global data definition (e.g., how &quot;Net Sales&quot; is calculated, or the hierarchy of a customer), the issue is escalated to the DGC. The Council reviews the business impact and arbitrates a final binding decision.
Responsible (R): CIO / DGC Members
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 1 hour/issue</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W474_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W474_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W474_Task8" name="Policy Ratification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Policy Ratification: The Council reviews and approves new or updated enterprise data policies, including data retention/archiving rules, data classification standards (e.g., PII vs. public), and ethical AI data usage guidelines.
Responsible (R): DGC Members
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 2 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W474_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W474_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W474_Task9" name="Data Stewardship Appointment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Data Stewardship Appointment: The Council formally appoints or reviews the performance of Business Data Owners (e.g., VP Merchandising owning Item Data) and Data Stewards, ensuring they have adequate resources.
Responsible (R): DGC Members
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 1 hour/annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W474_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W474_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W474_Task10" name="Strategic Roadmap Alignment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Strategic Roadmap Alignment: The Council reviews the enterprise data roadmap (e.g., transitioning to a new MDM platform, onboarding third-party data, implementing data catalogs) and secures executive sponsorship and budget.
Responsible (R): CIO
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours/annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W474_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W474_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W474_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W474_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W474_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-289 (ensure controlled execution — GL &amp; Financial Close (PA-17.1).) | - operational: Chief Data Officer (or CIO acting as DGC Chair) review and approval gate
Owner: Chief Information Officer (CIO)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W474_Assoc13" sourceRef="W474_Annotation12" targetRef="W474_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
